# Based on CYLTabBarController's .gitignore
# (https://github.com/ChenYilong/CYLTabBarController/blob/master/.gitignore), with its project names changed to
# ChatKit and ChatKit-OC. Entries for folders that only exist in CYLTabBarController (Example-Shared/PAGResources,
# Example-SwiftUI-Rive, Example-loadTabBarIconsFroNework) are left out. Keep this file in step with that one before
# every commit (AGENTS.md, "Git changes").

.DS_Store
ChatKit/ChatKit.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
ChatKit-OC/ChatKit-OC.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
ChatKit/ChatKit.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
ChatKit-OC/ChatKit-OC.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
build/
*.pbxuser
!default.pbxuser
*.mode1v3
!default.mode1v3
*.mode2v3
!default.mode2v3
*.perspectivev3
!default.perspectivev3
!default.xcworkspace
xcuserdata
*.moved-aside
*.mobileprovision
DerivedData
.idea/
Pods
# Lock files (*.lock: Podfile.lock, Gemfile.lock, ...) and workspaces generated by `pod install`, as in
# CYLTabBarController. Files already tracked here (ChatKit/Podfile.lock, ChatKit-OC/Podfile.lock, the existing
# .xcworkspace contents) stay tracked until they are removed from the index on purpose; see docs/ci.md.
*.lock
*.xcworkspace

*.xcuserstate
*.xcbkptlist

# Xcode

